
参考：https://blog.quindorian.org/2018/03/building-a-2u-amd-ryzen-server-proxmox-gpu-passthrough.html/

BIOS 设置：

- Enable IOMUU
- Enable SVM

GRUB 设置：

- ``amd_iommu=on iommu=pt video=vesafb:off,efifb:off``

`解释 <https://passthroughpo.st/explaining-csm-efifboff-setting-boot-gpu-manually/>`_

0a:00.0

1002:67ff
1002:aae0


echo options vfio-pci ids=1002:67ff,1002:aae0 disable_vga=1 > /etc/modprobe.d/vfio.conf

hostpci0: 0a:00,x-vga=on,pcie=1
